/target
/cockpit/node_modules
/cockpit/dist
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store
*.snap.new
# QEMU guest assets: disk images, cloud-init seed, SSH keypair, launch
# scripts, serial log. ~51 GB of qcow2 -- must never be staged. Kept in the
# repo directory (user request, 2026-07-30) so everything VM-related lives in
# one place instead of scattering under the home directory.
/.vm/
/shr-vm/
# Local RPM builds (packaging/shr-rs.spec.in -> shr-rs.spec, rpmbuild trees,
# the assembled binary source tarball). The release workflow produces these in
# a container; nothing generated belongs in the repo.
/shr-rs.spec
/shr-rs-*.tar.gz
# `cargo about generate` output. Regenerated by the release workflow from the
# Cargo.lock it is shipping, so a committed copy could only ever be stale.
/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
/*.rpm
/out/
/rpmbuild/
/buildroot/
# Scratch file for composing a commit message (`git commit -F`). Non-ASCII
# messages get mangled when passed as a shell argument on Windows, so they are
# written to a file first -- which `git add -A` would otherwise sweep in.
/.commitmsg
